{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_animation":true,"content_width":"custom","custom_content_width":700}},"rich_text_WrLwUj":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_KnBYF6":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Private Label & Contract Manufacturing","heading_tag":"h1","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-1-base"}},"text_gcJ4md":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Pastel Pines is Australia’s leading private label home fragrance manufacturer, specialising in custom products such as candles, reed diffusers, room sprays, perfumes, essential oils, and bespoke fragranced collections. With more than 50 years of combined expertise in fragrance manufacturing, we proudly craft high‑quality, Australian‑made products designed to elevate your brand.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100"}}},"block_order":["heading_KnBYF6","text_gcJ4md"],"name":"t:sections.rich_text.presets.name","settings":{"alignment":"center_left","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-bottom","content_width":"full","custom_content_width":700,"background_color":"#f2ebe9","text_color":"#332e26","cutsom_class":"spacing-top-40 large-header"}},"image_hero_width_gwgLPe":{"type":"image-hero-width","name":"Image Hero width","settings":{"image_aspect":"original","desktop_height":100,"mobile_height":100,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Private-Label_Header_Edited.png","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Private-Label_Header_Edited.png","focal_point":"image_presentation","mobile_focal_point":"image_presentation","media_link":"","text_position":"center_center","text_position_mobile":"center_center","text_color":"#ffffff","button_background_color":"#ffffff","button_text_color":"#000000","color_overlay":"#000000","color_overlay_gradient":"","overlay_opacity":0,"enable_animation":true,"section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-none"}},"multi_column_xC6iMp":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"column_dQ4aRg":{"type":"column","settings":{"accent":"","heading":"Custom Home Fragrance Solutions","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-5-base","text":"<p>We collaborate with businesses of all sizes, from global retailers and wholesalers to boutique entrepreneurs, to bring unique product ideas to life. Every fragrance project is tailored to your brand’s vision, whether it’s selecting the perfect scent profile, designing packaging that reflects your identity, or developing a cohesive product range.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"column_T6Upif":{"type":"column","settings":{"accent":"","heading":"End‑to‑End Manufacturing Services","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-5-base","text":"<p>Our full‑service private labelling process covers product development, sourcing, filling, design, and manufacturing, ensuring your products are market‑ready without the hassle of multiple suppliers. We also provide bottling and filling services, allowing you to outsource production and focus on growing your business.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["column_dQ4aRg","column_T6Upif"],"name":"t:sections.multi_column.presets.name","settings":{"title":"","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-3-base","subheading":"","heading_alignment":"center","content_vertical_alignment":"top","content_background_padding":"medium","columns":"2","column_spacing":35,"row_spacing":35,"column_alignment":"center","enable_slider_mobile":false,"columns_mobile":"1","column_spacing_mobile":20,"row_spacing_mobile":50,"column_alignment_mobile":"center","background_behind_columns":false,"background_color":"#f2ebe9","text_color":"#332e26","button_background_color":"#000000","button_text_color":"#ffffff","enable_animation":true,"divider_style":"none","section_padding":"section--vertical-padding-top-bottom","cutsom_class":"multi-column-section-space  multi-column-heading mobile-small-specing base-body-heading"}},"multi_column_49AjGf":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"image_column_wMr9Pm":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/a5e8cad89fc2682b0830f0b76a559d2fe05f4cbc.png","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"natural","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Step 1: \u2028Brief & Quotation","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>We begin by learning about your brand, product vision, and requirements to understand exactly what you want to create. From there, our team prepares a detailed quotation outlining the best options to suit your goals, budget, and timeline.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_hd8TAG":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/0edce9567919b2339cb0128b911dda2e942d080a.png","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"square","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Step 2: \u2028Vessel Selection","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>Choose from our wide range of quality vessels and packaging options, or let us help you source something custom to perfectly complement your brand aesthetic. We’ll guide you through materials, shapes, and finishes to ensure your product stands out on the shelf.<\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_QrM9ce":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5ff29b199842667f7beae9323d0291a2c4a2680d.png","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"square","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Step 3:   Fragrance Selection","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>Explore our extensive library of premium fragrances, from timeless classics to bespoke <br\/>scent creations. Our fragrance experts will help you find or develop a scent profile that aligns seamlessly with your brand identity and target audience.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}},"image_column_DzxciM":{"type":"image_column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4e721e7a6c59a76a431c24351247fa383a5cccd2.png","image_width":100,"aspect_ratio":"square","enable_image_crop_circle":false,"focal_point":"image_presentation","image_position":"above_text","image_link":"","small_caption":"","accent":"","heading":"Step 4: Packaging  \u2028& Label Design","heading_tag":"h3","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-4-base","text":"<p>We assist with designing or refining your labels and packaging to bring your brand vision<br\/>to life. Our design and production teams ensure every detail, from print quality to presentation, reflects the care and craftsmanship behind your collection.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_font_class":"fs-body-100","text_max_width":100,"link":"","link_text":"","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["image_column_wMr9Pm","image_column_hd8TAG","image_column_QrM9ce","image_column_DzxciM"],"name":"t:sections.multi_column.presets.name","settings":{"title":"<p>The Process With Us<\/p>","heading_tag":"h2","heading_font_class":"fs-heading-3-base","subheading":"","heading_alignment":"center","content_vertical_alignment":"top","content_background_padding":"small","columns":"2","column_spacing":17,"row_spacing":24,"column_alignment":"center","enable_slider_mobile":false,"columns_mobile":"1","column_spacing_mobile":4,"row_spacing_mobile":4,"column_alignment_mobile":"center","background_behind